# Build context for docker/backend.Dockerfile. BuildKit reads the ignore file
# named after the Dockerfile before falling back to the context root's, which
# is what lets the two images share the repository root as their context and
# still exclude different things.
#
# Without this, the context is the ~1.6 GB of gitignored corpus under
# backend/data and every build re-uploads it.

*

!backend/requirements.txt
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/app/
!backend/tests/

backend/**/__pycache__/
backend/**/*.pyc
